{"id":"ghostweight","lines":[{"t":0,"end":2.784,"chars":[0],"who":"Hajime","text":"(laugh) You'll have to catch me first fat ass","de":"(lacht) Erst musst du mich kriegen, Fettarsch","orig":"scenes/ghostweight/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":2.768,"end":5.101,"chars":[1],"who":"Satsuki","text":"Come back here you coward","de":"Komm zurück, du Feigling","orig":"scenes/ghostweight/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":6.224,"end":8.141,"chars":[0],"who":"Hajime","text":"You lose weight you'd move faster","de":"Wenn du abnimmst, wärst du schneller","orig":"scenes/ghostweight/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":6.651,"end":8.595,"chars":[1],"who":"Satsuki","text":"Scream","de":"*Schrei*","orig":"scenes/ghostweight/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":8.144,"end":9.774,"chars":[2],"who":"Music Teacher","text":"Hold it right there","de":"Sofort stehen bleiben","orig":"scenes/ghostweight/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":9.801,"end":12.83,"chars":[0],"who":"Hajime","text":"Oh the music teacher what a bitch","de":"Oh, die Musiklehrerin — was für eine Zicke","orig":"scenes/ghostweight/lines/06.mp3"}]}